      "options": {
        "content": "<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-around; padding: 15px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\">\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; margin: 0 8px; padding: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,242,254,0.15), rgba(0,242,254,0.05)); border: 1px solid #00F2FE; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,242,254,0.2);\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 24px;\">📱</div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #00F2FE; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px;\">UERANSIM RAN</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94A3B8;\">UE &amp; gNB (3GPP Rel-16)<br>PLMN: 001/01 | TAC: 1</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"font-size: 22px; color: #00F2FE; font-weight: bold;\">➔</div>\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; margin: 0 8px; padding: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(121,40,202,0.15), rgba(121,40,202,0.05)); border: 1px solid #7928CA; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(121,40,202,0.2);\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 24px;\">⚙️</div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #7928CA; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px;\">5G SA Core</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94A3B8;\">AMF | SMF | UPF | NRF<br>NGAP (SCTP 38412) · PFCP (UDP 8805)</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"font-size: 22px; color: #7928CA; font-weight: bold;\">➔</div>\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; margin: 0 8px; padding: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,230,118,0.15), rgba(0,230,118,0.05)); border: 1px solid #00E676; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,230,118,0.2);\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 24px;\">📞</div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #00E676; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px;\">SIP/IMS Proxy</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94A3B8;\">Kamailio &amp; RTPEngine<br>UDP 5066 &amp; RTPEngine NG 22222</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"font-size: 22px; color: #00E676; font-weight: bold;\">➔</div>\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; margin: 0 8px; padding: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,145,0,0.15), rgba(255,145,0,0.05)); border: 1px solid #FF9100; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,145,0,0.2);\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 24px;\">🛡️</div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #FF9100; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px;\">Telecom Gateway</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94A3B8;\">Spring Boot | EIR Tracker<br>Prepaid OCS Check</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"font-size: 22px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: bold;\">➔</div>\n  <div style=\"flex: 1; margin: 0 8px; padding: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,8,68,0.15), rgba(255,8,68,0.05)); border: 1px solid #FF0844; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,8,68,0.2);\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 24px;\">🤖</div>\n    <div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #FF0844; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px;\">AI Classifier</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94A3B8;\">Python Model Server (mock)<br>POST /api/v1/classify</div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
